<title>
Front Window Regulator Assembly Inspection
</title>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0A9506010">Front Window Regulator Assembly Removal and Installation</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A9506011001">
<title>
Driver Side
</title>
<ptxt>
Check motor movement as follows.
</ptxt>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Connect battery positive terminal to terminal “1” and connect battery negative terminal to terminal “3”. (UP operation)
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Connect battery positive terminal to terminal “3” and connect battery negative terminal to terminal “1”. (DOWN operation)
</ptxt>
</s1>
<ptxt>
If operation is not smooth, check glass run, door outer weather-strip, door inner weather-strip and grease in link. If those parts are in good condition, replace window regulator.
</ptxt>
