<title>
Passenger Side
</title>
<ptxt>
Check motor movement as follows.
</ptxt>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Connect battery positive terminal to terminal “1” and connect battery negative terminal to terminal “2”.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
(UP operation)
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Connect battery positive terminal to terminal “2” and connect battery negative terminal to terminal “1”.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
(DOWN operation)
</ptxt>
</s1>
<ptxt>
If operation is not smooth, check glass run, door outer weather-strip, door inner weather-strip and grease in link. If those parts are in good condition, replace window regulator.
